# Secrets stay local

WiFi names and passwords live in `includes/esp32/esp32.ino` because that is convenient when flashing the ESP32.

When committing or pushing this plugin to GitHub:

- Leave SSID names as they are (`WIFI_SSID_1`, `WIFI_SSID_2`, `WIFI_SSID_3`).
- Clear only the password values (`WIFI_PASSWORD_1`, `WIFI_PASSWORD_2`, `WIFI_PASSWORD_3`) to empty strings `""`.
- Never commit real WiFi passwords, API keys, or other secrets.
- After the GitHub commit, restore the real passwords in the local `esp32.ino` so flashing still works.
